From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Taixin Reverse <reverse@taixin.local>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 17:13:47 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] kernel: btsdio for the onboard AIC8800D80 Bluetooth half

CONFIG_BT was on for the USB dongle only; the -W module BT half sits
on the SAME SDIO bus as WiFi and needs CONFIG_BT_HCIBTSDIO: once
aicbsp enables the BT subsystem (fmacfwbt_8800d80_u02 firmware) the
generic btsdio HCI driver binds the SDIO function and hci0 appears
(S37bluetooth already waits for it). Fixes "no Bluetooth stack in
the kernel" on the -W boards.
---
 .../linux/sg2002_licheervnano_sd_defconfig                       | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/build/boards/sg200x/sg2002_licheervnano_sd/linux/sg2002_licheervnano_sd_defconfig b/build/boards/sg200x/sg2002_licheervnano_sd/linux/sg2002_licheervnano_sd_defconfig
index 5d4592aa0..0c9a9ffec 100644
--- a/build/boards/sg200x/sg2002_licheervnano_sd/linux/sg2002_licheervnano_sd_defconfig
+++ b/build/boards/sg200x/sg2002_licheervnano_sd/linux/sg2002_licheervnano_sd_defconfig
@@ -525,6 +525,7 @@ CONFIG_IP_MULTICAST=y
 CONFIG_BT=y
 CONFIG_BT_LE=y
 CONFIG_BT_HCIBTUSB=y
+CONFIG_BT_HCIBTSDIO=y
 # CONFIG_BT_HCIUART is not set
 # CONFIG_BT_HCIUART_BCSP is not set
 # CONFIG_BT_HCIUART_H4 is not set
-- 
